# Product documentation

Canonical docs live under `docs/`. Index: `docs/SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md`.

- `SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md` — which files win on conflict (product, code, agents)
- `PRD.md` — requirements, phases, status tables
- `SYSTEM_DESIGN.md` — decisions, context/container diagrams
- `ARCHITECTURE.md` — layers, sequence/data flows, module pattern
- `DATA_MODEL.md` — ERD, fields; defer to `prisma/schema.prisma` on conflict
- `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` — tokens, components, theming

Agent-facing context shared on GitHub: root `AGENTS.md`, `llms.txt`, `.github/copilot-instructions.md`, `.cursor/rules/`.

When implementing a planned nav module (expenses, budgets, etc.), update PRD status and enable nav only when the route works. Reflect schema/layer changes in ARCHITECTURE, SYSTEM_DESIGN, and DATA_MODEL. New colors or component patterns belong in DESIGN_SYSTEM (prefer CSS variables over hard-coded values). Prefer Mermaid diagrams in markdown over binary images.
